<title>GERMANY: Buba says Jan min reserve requirement 40 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>Buba says Jan min reserve requirement 40 bln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thursday the preliminary minimum reserve requirement for January was 40.0 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
